    <title>2026_11_15</title>
    <published>2026-11-15T10:05:18Z</published>
    <updated>2026-11-17T12:57:46Z</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Q: What is the largest number of points on the plain, each two of which have the equal &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\ell_1$&lt;/span&gt; distance?
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$x \in B(y)$&lt;/span&gt;, then &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$B(x) \cap B(y) \leq 2$&lt;/span&gt;. Where &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$B()$&lt;/span&gt; is the &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\ell_1$&lt;/span&gt; ball of the plane.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$x,\ y$&lt;/span&gt;  have \ell 1 distance &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$d$&lt;/span&gt;, what is the number of other points having the equal distance from &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$x$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$y$&lt;/span&gt;?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The answer is &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$2$&lt;/span&gt;, as the inequality above asserts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;So, the maximal number of pairwise &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\ell_1$&lt;/span&gt;-equidistant points on &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\mathbb R^2$&lt;/span&gt; is &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\boxed 4$&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;org-task task-done&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;task-status&quot;&gt;DONE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;task-title&quot;&gt;dual and support vectors t10 task 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;task-logbook&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;⏱ 7s · 10 entries · 1 open&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;logbook-rows&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;0s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:27&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:29&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:29&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:31&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:31&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;0s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:32&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:32&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;0s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:35&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;2s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 20:06:37&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end clock-open&quot;&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur clock-open&quot;&gt;running&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;dual form. For SVM, &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\bm w=\sum \alpha_i y_i  \bm x_i$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hessian is negative semi-definite =&amp;gt; function is concave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hard margin SVM =&amp;gt; support vector is on the boundary. We can use this to compute &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$b$&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;full margin is &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\frac{2}{\|w\|_2}$&lt;/span&gt;. Primal objective is &lt;span class=&quot;math inline&quot;&gt;$\frac{1}{2} \|w\|_2$&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;org-task task-todo&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;task-status&quot;&gt;TODO&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;task-title&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://distill.pub/2019/paths-perspective-on-value-learning/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot;&gt;https://distill.pub/2019/paths-perspective-on-value-learning/&lt;/a&gt; 想一下怎么可视化自己的rl项目&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;task-logbook&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;⏱ 1h 31m · 2 entries&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;logbook-rows&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-15 Sun 23:34:53&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-16 Mon 00:35:30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;1h 37s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;logbook-row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-start&quot;&gt;2026-11-16 Mon 00:35:38&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-arrow&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-end&quot;&gt;2026-11-16 Mon 01:06:20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;clock-dur&quot;&gt;30m 42s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
